# assets.links — Download locations for the big installation files.
#
# The install zips/exe/deb (several GB) are NOT in the Git repo (the repo must
# stay light and under the GitHub limit). This file centralizes where each one
# can be downloaded, for apps/ and its subfolders.
#
# Line format:  <relative_destination_path> | <url> | <sha256 (optional)>
# "destination_path" is relative to the repo root (e.g. apps/ableton/...).
# If sha256 is set, download-assets.sh verifies it after downloading
# (the Ableton .run is already verified by setup-ableton.sh --check-update).
#
# Deliberately ABSENT: DaVinci Resolve — the Blackmagic zip (~7 GB) is placed
# by hand in apps/davinci/ by the user (download outside the scripts).

# ─── Ableton Live (editions) ───
# The native installer install-ableton-latest.run downloads itself via
# setup-ableton.sh --check-update; only the edition zips are listed here.
apps/ableton/ableton_live_intro_12.4.5_64.zip | TON_HEBERGEUR/ableton_live_intro_12.4.5_64.zip | 28427dbc4a33dd082ebe3b2f6942023087199a386cbf62edb73d0ffb80440e2b
apps/ableton/ableton_live_suite_12.3.6_64.zip | TON_HEBERGEUR/ableton_live_suite_12.3.6_64.zip | 270fe1027e6174ffb8ae061841b11338da326d75dd939df72d9c5ea1544f2074
apps/ableton/ableton_live_suite_12.4.5_64.zip | TON_HEBERGEUR/ableton_live_suite_12.4.5_64.zip | 67fe60e07cff6d22823504eab0efab4c60075ec8f53e0388dbb47ec9558cb9ad

